    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616230/extras/1c4bedd105161f7c8e2c8914a4d8990c.webp?t=1753298774\" width=24 height=24 /></span>\u00a0<strong>GLYPHS</strong> is a difficult puzzle-platformer about exploration and persistence.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616230/extras/1c4bedd105161f7c8e2c8914a4d8990c.webp?t=1753298774\" width=24 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the depths of the Tomb of Forbidden Knowledge; a sentient labyrinth containing traces of the past in the form of glyphs. Formidable bosses, platforming, and puzzles stand in the way of discovery - GLYPHS fulfills the extent that one willingly searches for true knowledge. Your determination dictates where this story will unfold.<br><br><strong>EPILEPSY WARNING</strong> - This game has occasional drastic color flashes/sudden color changes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >450+ rooms to explore, platform through, and discover secrets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses and trials serve to award you new platforming abilities and knowledge to help you uncover further areas of the tomb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Layered puzzles scattered throughout the regions, some much more noticeable than others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Sound Track</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An massive underlying plot discoverable through the glyphs dotting the tomb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simplistic and gradual platforming mechanic progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There is always a path forward.<br>The well is <strong>much</strong> deeper than it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616230/extras/1c4bedd105161f7c8e2c8914a4d8990c.webp?t=1753298774\" width=24 height=24 /></span>\u00a0<strong>GLYPHS</strong> is a difficult puzzle-platformer about exploration and persistence.\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616230/extras/1c4bedd105161f7c8e2c8914a4d8990c.webp?t=1753298774\" width=24 height=24 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the depths of the Tomb of Forbidden Knowledge; a sentient labyrinth containing traces of the past in the form of glyphs. Formidable bosses, platforming, and puzzles stand in the way of discovery - GLYPHS fulfills the extent that one willingly searches for true knowledge. Your determination dictates where this story will unfold.<br><br><strong>EPILEPSY WARNING</strong> - This game has occasional drastic color flashes/sudden color changes</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >450+ rooms to explore, platform through, and discover secrets</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses and trials serve to award you new platforming abilities and knowledge to help you uncover further areas of the tomb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Layered puzzles scattered throughout the regions, some much more noticeable than others</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Original Sound Track</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An massive underlying plot discoverable through the glyphs dotting the tomb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simplistic and gradual platforming mechanic progression</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > There is always a path forward.<br>The well is <strong>much</strong> deeper than it seems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>",
